```

**Real-World Attack Simulation:**
```javascript
// Simulate web API that accepts user file prefix
function createUserTempFile(userPrefix, content) {
  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
    tmp.file({ prefix: userPrefix }, (err, path, fd, cleanup) => {
